Almanac contains algorithms translated from Astronomy Engine
(https://github.com/cosinekitty/astronomy), copyright (c) 2019+ Don Cross,
released under the MIT License.

Astronomy Engine's lunar theory derives from "Astronomy on the Personal
Computer" by Oliver Montenbruck and Thomas Pfleger; its solar theory from
the VSOP87 model by Bretagnon and Francou.

Translation is pinned to Astronomy Engine commit
